---
import { ArrowUpRight, Mail, AtSign, ClipboardList } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section id="contacto" class="contact-page">
	<div class="contact-page-inner">
		<p class="contact-intro">Elige el canal adecuado para tu consulta y comunícate directamente con nuestro equipo.</p>

		<div class="contact-admissions">
			<div class="contact-admissions-icon"><ClipboardList size={30} strokeWidth={1.7} /></div>
			<div class="contact-admissions-copy">
				<p class="contact-card-label">Admisiones</p>
				<h2>Comienza tu proceso de admisión</h2>
				<p>Completa el formulario oficial del colegio o escríbenos si necesitas orientación.</p>
				<a class="contact-email" href="mailto:admisiones@uecolegiosantagema.com">admisiones@uecolegiosantagema.com</a>
			</div>
			<a class="contact-form-link" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeCMifM5tZO5TDikC-exvSBLIL8ORDPxWRYouS-R9vXhYxX-w/viewform?usp=header" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ir al formulario <ArrowUpRight size={18} /><span class="sr-only"> (abre en una pestaña nueva)</span></a>
		</div>

		<div class="contact-details">
			<div class="contact-details-heading"><p class="contact-eyebrow">Canales de atención</p><h2>Hablemos directamente.</h2></div>
			<div class="contact-methods">
				<article class="contact-method"><span class="contact-method-icon"><Mail size={23} strokeWidth={1.7} /></span><p class="contact-card-label">Secretaría · consultas generales</p><a href="mailto:Secretaria@uecolegiosantagema.com">Secretaria@uecolegiosantagema.com</a></article>
				<article class="contact-method"><span class="contact-method-icon"><img src="/social/whatsapp.svg" width="23" height="23" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /></span><p class="contact-card-label">WhatsApp general</p><a href="https://wa.me/584242487238" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">+58 424 248 7238<span class="sr-only"> (abre WhatsApp en una pestaña nueva)</span></a></article>
				<article class="contact-method"><span class="contact-method-icon"><img src="/social/whatsapp.svg" width="23" height="23" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /></span><p class="contact-card-label">WhatsApp administración</p><a href="https://wa.me/584241834374" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">+58 424 183 4374<span class="sr-only"> (abre WhatsApp en una pestaña nueva)</span></a></article>
				<article class="contact-method"><span class="contact-method-icon"><AtSign size={23} strokeWidth={1.7} /></span><p class="contact-card-label">Comunicación y redes</p><a href="mailto:colegiosantagemaredes@gmail.com">colegiosantagemaredes@gmail.com</a></article>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="contact-social">
			<div><p class="contact-eyebrow">Síguenos</p><h2>La vida del colegio, día a día.</h2></div>
			<div class="contact-social-links">
				<a href="https://www.instagram.com/santagemave/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/social/instagram.svg" width="22" height="22" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /> Instagram <ArrowUpRight size={16} /><span class="sr-only"> (abre en una pestaña nueva)</span></a>
				<a href="https://www.threads.com/@santagemave" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/social/threads.svg" width="22" height="22" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /> Threads <ArrowUpRight size={16} /><span class="sr-only"> (abre en una pestaña nueva)</span></a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.contact-page { padding: 5rem 1.5rem 7rem; color: #0f172a; background: linear-gradient(160deg, #e8f4ff 0%, #f8fbff 45%, #e7f5f0 100%); }
	.contact-page-inner { width: min(100%, 80rem); margin-inline: auto; }
	.contact-eyebrow, .contact-card-label { margin: 0; color: #047857; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.contact-intro { max-width: 54rem; margin: 0; color: #475569; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.7; }
	.contact-admissions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 4rem; padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem); border-radius: 2rem; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(115deg, #10243d, #17458a 70%, #0c7a78); box-shadow: 0 25px 55px rgb(19 53 99 / 20%); }
	.contact-admissions-icon { display: grid; width: 4rem; height: 4rem; place-items: center; border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 30%); border-radius: 1.1rem; color: #a7f3d0; background: rgb(255 255 255 / 9%); }
	.contact-admissions .contact-card-label { color: #a7f3d0; }
	.contact-admissions h2 { margin: .65rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; }
	.contact-admissions-copy > p:not(.contact-card-label) { margin: .8rem 0 0; color: #dbeafe; line-height: 1.6; }
	.contact-email { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.1rem; color: #fff; font-weight: 650; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #86efac; text-underline-offset: .3rem; }
	.contact-form-link { display: inline-flex; gap: .6rem; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 3.2rem; padding: .8rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 999px; color: #10243d; background: #fff; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s ease; }
	.contact-form-link:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #d1fae5; }
	.contact-details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .65fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); margin-top: 6rem; }
	.contact-details-heading h2, .contact-social h2 { margin: 1rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
	.contact-methods { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
	.contact-method { min-width: 0; padding: 1.6rem; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 1.4rem; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgb(15 23 42 / 5%); }
	.contact-method-icon { display: grid; width: 2.8rem; height: 2.8rem; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 1.3rem; border-radius: .9rem; color: #1d4ed8; background: #dbeafe; }
	.contact-method a { display: inline-block; margin-top: .7rem; color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.03rem; font-weight: 650; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
	.contact-method a:hover { color: #1d4ed8; text-decoration: underline; }
	.contact-social { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 6rem; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #bfcee1; }
	.contact-social h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.7rem); }
	.contact-social-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; }
	.contact-social-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; min-height: 3.2rem; padding: .8rem 1.15rem; border: 1px solid #bfd2e8; border-radius: 999px; color: #17345f; background: #fff; font-weight: 700; transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
	.contact-social-links a:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #dbeafe; }
	@media (max-width: 900px) { .contact-admissions { grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); } .contact-form-link { grid-column: 2; justify-self: start; } .contact-details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
	@media (max-width: 650px) { .contact-page { padding-top: 4rem; } .contact-admissions { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .contact-form-link { grid-column: 1; } .contact-methods { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .contact-social { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; } }
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .contact-form-link, .contact-social-links a { transition: none; } }
</style>
